// right: not in English ("form", "wether", "calender", "cant", "wont", "its", "lets" are
// left out), and, as far as could be told, not in another language written with the same
// letters ("dont", "adn", "independant" and "persistant" are French, "im" and "frist" German,
// "adress" Swedish, "dilema" Spanish). Words
